{"seq":1,"slug":"type-annotations-and-inference","title":"类型注解与类型推断","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/typescript/basic-types/type-annotations-and-inference","wordCount":900,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"类型注解与类型推断\">类型注解与类型推断</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>TypeScript 的类型系统建立在两个互补的机制之上：<strong>类型注解</strong>（Type Annotation）和<strong>类型推断</strong>（Type Inference）。类型注解是开发者显式地为变量、参数或返回值标注类型；类型推断则是编译器根据上下文自动推导出类型。两者协作，在保证类型安全的同时减少冗余代码。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    A[Source Code] --&gt; B{Has Explicit Annotation?}&#10;    B -- Yes --&gt; C[Use Annotated Type]&#10;    B -- No --&gt; D{Can Infer from Context?}&#10;    D -- Yes --&gt; E[Use Inferred Type]&#10;    D -- No --&gt; F[&quot;Implicit any (Error in Strict Mode)&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; G[Type Determined]&#10;    E --&gt; G&#10;    F --&gt; G\">flowchart LR\n    A[Source Code] --&gt; B{Has Explicit Annotation?}\n    B -- Yes --&gt; C[Use Annotated Type]\n    B -- No --&gt; D{Can Infer from Context?}\n    D -- Yes --&gt; E[Use Inferred Type]\n    D -- No --&gt; F[\"Implicit any (Error in Strict Mode)\"]\n    C --&gt; G[Type Determined]\n    E --&gt; G\n    F --&gt; G</pre><p>理解何时需要注解、何时可以依赖推断，是编写高质量 TypeScript 代码的基础能力。</p>\n<h2 id=\"基本语法\">基本语法</h2><h3 id=\"类型注解\">类型注解</h3><p>类型注解使用 <code>: Type</code> 语法，放在变量名、参数名或函数返回值之后：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"const name: string = &#39;TypeScript&#39;;&#10;let count: number = 0;&#10;let isReady: boolean = false;&#10;&#10;function greet(person: string): string {&#10;  return `Hello, ${person}!`;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> name</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'TypeScript'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> count</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> isReady</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> boolean</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> false</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> greet</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">person</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> `Hello, ${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">person</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}!`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"类型推断\">类型推断</h3><p>当变量在声明时被赋值，TypeScript 会自动推断其类型，无需显式注解：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"const name = &#39;TypeScript&#39;; // 推断为 &quot;TypeScript&quot;（字面量类型）&#10;let count = 0; // 推断为 number&#10;let isReady = false; // 推断为 boolean&#10;&#10;function greet(person: string) {&#10;  return `Hello, ${person}!`; // 返回类型推断为 string&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> name</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'TypeScript'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 推断为 \"TypeScript\"（字面量类型）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> count </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 推断为 number</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> isReady </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> false</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 推断为 boolean</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> greet</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">person</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> `Hello, ${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">person</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}!`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 返回类型推断为 string</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"类型推断行为\">类型推断行为</h2><h3 id=\"let-与-const-的推断差异\"><code>let</code> 与 <code>const</code> 的推断差异</h3><p><code>let</code> 和 <code>const</code> 声明在推断行为上有本质区别。<code>const</code> 声明的值不可变，编译器会将其推断为更窄的<strong>字面量类型</strong>；<code>let</code> 声明的值可变，编译器会将其<strong>拓宽</strong>为基础类型。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"const message = &#39;hello&#39;; // 类型为 &quot;hello&quot;（字面量类型）&#10;let greeting = &#39;hello&#39;; // 类型为 string（拓宽）&#10;&#10;const num = 42; // 类型为 42&#10;let value = 42; // 类型为 number&#10;&#10;const flag = true; // 类型为 true&#10;let toggle = true; // 类型为 boolean\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> message</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'hello'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 类型为 \"hello\"（字面量类型）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> greeting </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'hello'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 类型为 string（拓宽）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> num</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 42</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 类型为 42</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> value </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 42</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 类型为 number</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> flag</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 类型为 true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> toggle </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 类型为 boolean</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[&quot;Declare Variable with Value&quot;] --&gt; B{Declaration Type?}&#10;    B -- const --&gt; C[&quot;Inferred as Literal Type&lt;br/&gt;const x = &#39;hi&#39; → &#39;hi&#39;&quot;]&#10;    B -- let --&gt; D[&quot;Widened to Base Type&lt;br/&gt;let x = &#39;hi&#39; → string&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; E[&quot;Cannot Reassign&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; F[&quot;Can Assign Any Value of Same Type&quot;]\">flowchart TD\n    A[\"Declare Variable with Value\"] --&gt; B{Declaration Type?}\n    B -- const --&gt; C[\"Inferred as Literal Type&lt;br/&gt;const x = 'hi' → 'hi'\"]\n    B -- let --&gt; D[\"Widened to Base Type&lt;br/&gt;let x = 'hi' → string\"]\n    C --&gt; E[\"Cannot Reassign\"]\n    D --&gt; F[\"Can Assign Any Value of Same Type\"]</pre><h3 id=\"最佳公共类型\">最佳公共类型</h3><p>当数组包含多种类型的值时，TypeScript 会计算所有元素的<strong>最佳公共类型</strong>（Best Common Type）：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"const mixed = [1, &#39;hello&#39;, true];&#10;// 推断为 (string | number | boolean)[]&#10;&#10;const nums = [1, 2, 3];&#10;// 推断为 number[]&#10;&#10;class Animal {}&#10;class Dog extends Animal {}&#10;class Cat extends Animal {}&#10;&#10;const pets = [new Dog(), new Cat()];&#10;// 推断为 (Dog | Cat)[]，而非 Animal[]\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> mixed</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'hello'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 推断为 (string | number | boolean)[]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> nums</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 推断为 number[]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Animal</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Dog</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> extends</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Animal</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Cat</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> extends</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Animal</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> pets</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Dog</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(), </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Cat</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 推断为 (Dog | Cat)[]，而非 Animal[]</span></span></code></pre></div><blockquote>\n<p>如果希望推断为基类类型，需要显式注解：<code>const pets: Animal[] = [new Dog(), new Cat()]</code>。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<h3 id=\"上下文类型-contextual-typing\">上下文类型（Contextual Typing）</h3><p>上下文类型是推断的反向过程——TypeScript 根据表达式所处的<strong>位置</strong>来推断其类型。最常见的场景是回调函数：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"const names = [&#39;Alice&#39;, &#39;Bob&#39;, &#39;Charlie&#39;];&#10;&#10;names.forEach((name) =&gt; {&#10;  console.log(name.toUpperCase());&#10;  // name 被推断为 string，因为 forEach 的回调签名已知&#10;});&#10;&#10;document.addEventListener(&#39;click&#39;, (event) =&gt; {&#10;  console.log(event.clientX);&#10;  // event 被推断为 MouseEvent&#10;});\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> names</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'Alice'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'Bob'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'Charlie'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">names.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">forEach</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">((</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  console.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">log</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(name.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">toUpperCase</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">());</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  // name 被推断为 string，因为 forEach 的回调签名已知</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">document.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">addEventListener</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'click'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">event</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  console.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">log</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(event.clientX);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  // event 被推断为 MouseEvent</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span></code></pre></div><p>上下文类型还适用于对象字面量、返回语句等场景：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"type Point = { x: number; y: number };&#10;&#10;const origin: Point = { x: 0, y: 0 };&#10;// 对象字面量的属性类型由 Point 约束&#10;&#10;function createPoint(): Point {&#10;  return { x: 10, y: 20 };&#10;  // 返回值由函数签名约束&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">type</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Point</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">x</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">y</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> origin</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Point</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { x: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, y: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 对象字面量的属性类型由 Point 约束</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> createPoint</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Point</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { x: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">10</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, y: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">20</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  // 返回值由函数签名约束</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"常见误区\">常见误区</h2><h3 id=\"误区一-所有地方都写注解\">误区一：所有地方都写注解</h3><p>过度注解会产生冗余代码，降低可读性：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// ❌ 冗余注解&#10;const name: string = &#39;TypeScript&#39;;&#10;const count: number = 42;&#10;const items: number[] = [1, 2, 3];&#10;&#10;// ✅ 让推断工作&#10;const name = &#39;TypeScript&#39;;&#10;const count = 42;&#10;const items = [1, 2, 3];\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// ❌ 冗余注解</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> name</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'TypeScript'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> count</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 42</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> items</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// ✅ 让推断工作</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> name</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'TypeScript'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> count</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 42</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> items</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">];</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"误区二-完全依赖推断\">误区二：完全依赖推断</h3><p>某些场景必须注解，否则编译器无法推断或会推断出过宽的类型：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// ❌ 参数缺少注解（严格模式下报错）&#10;function double(n) {&#10;  return n * 2;&#10;}&#10;&#10;// ✅ 参数必须注解&#10;function double(n: number): number {&#10;  return n * 2;&#10;}&#10;&#10;// ❌ 空数组推断为 any[]&#10;const items = [];&#10;&#10;// ✅ 空数组需要注解&#10;const items: string[] = [];\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// ❌ 参数缺少注解（严格模式下报错）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> double</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">n</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> n </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// ✅ 参数必须注解</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> double</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">n</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> n </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// ❌ 空数组推断为 any[]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> items</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// ✅ 空数组需要注解</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> items</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [];</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"误区三-混淆注解与断言\">误区三：混淆注解与断言</h3><p>类型注解是声明时的约束，类型断言是告诉编译器&quot;我比你更了解类型&quot;。两者语义不同：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// 类型注解 — 编译器会验证赋值是否兼容&#10;const value: number = 42;&#10;&#10;// 类型断言 — 绕过编译器的类型检查&#10;const input = document.getElementById(&#39;name&#39;) as HTMLInputElement;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 类型注解 — 编译器会验证赋值是否兼容</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> value</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 42</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 类型断言 — 绕过编译器的类型检查</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> input</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> document.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">getElementById</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'name'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">as</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> HTMLInputElement</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"注解风格对比\">注解风格对比</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>场景</th>\n<th>是否需要注解</th>\n<th>原因</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>变量初始化赋值</td>\n<td>通常不需要</td>\n<td>推断即可确定类型</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>函数参数</td>\n<td><strong>必须</strong></td>\n<td>编译器无法从调用处推断参数类型</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>函数返回值</td>\n<td>推荐</td>\n<td>防止实现与意图不一致</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>空数组 / 空对象</td>\n<td><strong>必须</strong></td>\n<td>否则推断为 <code>any[]</code> / <code>{}</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>回调参数</td>\n<td>通常不需要</td>\n<td>上下文类型会自动推断</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>类属性（未初始化）</td>\n<td><strong>必须</strong></td>\n<td>无初始值时编译器无法推断</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>显式约束接口</td>\n<td>推荐</td>\n<td>提供更清晰的 API 契约</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"与-javascript-的关系\">与 JavaScript 的关系</h2><p>JavaScript 是动态类型语言，变量的类型在运行时确定。TypeScript 在此基础上增加了编译期的静态类型检查，但<strong>所有类型信息在编译后会被完全擦除</strong>，生成的 JavaScript 代码与手写无异：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// TypeScript 源码&#10;function add(a: number, b: number): number {&#10;  return a + b;&#10;}&#10;&#10;// 编译后的 JavaScript&#10;function add(a, b) {&#10;  return a + b;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// TypeScript 源码</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> add</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">a</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">b</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> a </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> b;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 编译后的 JavaScript</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> add</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">a</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">b</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> a </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> b;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    A[&quot;TypeScript Source&lt;br/&gt;(with Type Annotations)&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;tsc Compiler&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; C[&quot;Type Checking&lt;br/&gt;(Compile Time)&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; D[&quot;JavaScript Output&lt;br/&gt;(Types Erased)&quot;]&#10;    C -- Error Found --&gt; E[&quot;Compilation Error&quot;]&#10;    C -- No Error --&gt; D\">flowchart LR\n    A[\"TypeScript Source&lt;br/&gt;(with Type Annotations)\"] --&gt; B[\"tsc Compiler\"]\n    B --&gt; C[\"Type Checking&lt;br/&gt;(Compile Time)\"]\n    B --&gt; D[\"JavaScript Output&lt;br/&gt;(Types Erased)\"]\n    C -- Error Found --&gt; E[\"Compilation Error\"]\n    C -- No Error --&gt; D</pre><p>这意味着：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>类型注解<strong>零运行时开销</strong></li>\n<li>TypeScript 是 JavaScript 的<strong>超集</strong>——任何合法的 JS 代码都是合法的 TS 代码</li>\n<li>类型系统仅在开发阶段提供保护，无法替代运行时校验</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>类型注解</strong>是显式标注类型，<strong>类型推断</strong>是编译器自动推导类型，两者互补。</li>\n<li><code>const</code> 声明推断为字面量类型，<code>let</code> 声明会拓宽为基础类型。</li>\n<li><strong>上下文类型</strong>允许 TypeScript 根据表达式所在位置反向推断类型。</li>\n<li>函数参数和空集合必须注解，变量初始化和回调通常可以依赖推断。</li>\n<li>所有类型信息在编译后被擦除，不产生运行时开销。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"类型注解与类型推断","id":"类型注解与类型推断"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"基本语法","id":"基本语法"},{"level":3,"text":"类型注解","id":"类型注解"},{"level":3,"text":"类型推断","id":"类型推断"},{"level":2,"text":"类型推断行为","id":"类型推断行为"},{"level":3,"text":"`let` 与 `const` 的推断差异","id":"let-与-const-的推断差异"},{"level":3,"text":"最佳公共类型","id":"最佳公共类型"},{"level":3,"text":"上下文类型（Contextual Typing）","id":"上下文类型-contextual-typing"},{"level":2,"text":"常见误区","id":"常见误区"},{"level":3,"text":"误区一：所有地方都写注解","id":"误区一-所有地方都写注解"},{"level":3,"text":"误区二：完全依赖推断","id":"误区二-完全依赖推断"},{"level":3,"text":"误区三：混淆注解与断言","id":"误区三-混淆注解与断言"},{"level":2,"text":"注解风格对比","id":"注解风格对比"},{"level":2,"text":"与 JavaScript 的关系","id":"与-javascript-的关系"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":null,"next":{"title":"原始类型与字面量类型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/typescript/basic-types/primitives-and-literal-types"}}